            124
          ],
          "printedRules": [
            "Time Being: to hit Max 12; to be hit 14; HP 12",
            "His fists and feet do ½ D6 points worth of damage (in case of an odd number round upward to the next whole.) Special: If the Time Being rolls 15 or better to hit, he vanishes after striking, and Max will be unable to strike him in that round.",
            "Max does 1 D6 worth of damage with his fists.",
            "If Max wins, turn to section 12.",
            "If he loses, turn to section 20.",
            "If he chooses to surrender before he runs out of hit points, turn to section 17."
          ]
        }
      }
